{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_04_end","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-4","storyName":"雪里蕻","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌在火场中救下了莫不服，原来莫不服也是惊蛰在寻找的证人。在惊蛰想要详细询问时，大理寺卿谌彻带人控制了现场。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["煌","莫不服","麟青砚","戴面具的人","慌张的厨师","门外的声音","谌彻"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_kjerag_h_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_bat_kjerag_h_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","id":8},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"35","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"当心！","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#7$1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"怎么回事——","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0.5","g":"0.2","b":"0.1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":21},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":23},{"type":"text","text":"火焰自头顶燃起，点点火星从天花板落下，引燃了灶台上的面粉和油，顷刻间，后厨就化作了一片火海。","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#4$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"咳咳咳——！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BA/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你......走......不用管我！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"捂住口鼻，别说话！","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这一招可能用得不是很熟练......试试吧。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麻烦低下头。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":35},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_windmagic","id":36},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_bg_58_g10_restaurantkitchen.png","x":"0","y":"0","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"1","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"煌拿起刀，在掌心划出一道口子。一个气旋在煌的掌心逐渐成形，随即又扩散出去，形成一道气浪。","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_strongwind","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_steam_sw","layer":"2","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":45},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":46},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","yFrom":"0","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"0.5","block":"false","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","id":48},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"5","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knockoverdish","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sundries","channel":"2","volum":"0.5","id":51},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"汹涌的气浪席卷了整个房间，火焰霎时熄灭，厨房中的厨具和货架也被吹得七零八落。","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"竟然有这样的本事......你难道是......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......多谢。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":60},{"type":"multiline","name":"煌","text":"不客气——","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":62},{"type":"multiline","name":"煌","text":"嗯？","id":63},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawbridge","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":68},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"煌抬头看去，吊灯架外饰已经烧得漆黑，露出通红的铁筋，架子在空中摇摇欲坠。","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"莫不服，躲开！","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#7$1","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"煌抓住了老人的手臂，想要将他拉到一旁，但吊灯已经落下——","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","afrom":"0.6","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"0.5","fadetime":"1.5","block":"false","id":87},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":88},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_lightningmagic","id":89},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashcello","delay":"1","channel":"2","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_windowbreak","delay":"1","channel":"3","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"一声沉闷的雷鸣后，原本径直坠下的残骸骤然改变了方向，被重重地砸在了墙上。","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","duration":"0.5","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......没事吧？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"惊蛰？！你怎么会在这？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......我是不是该问问，你又为什么会出现在这里？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"回头再和你算账......","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"上个月，鼎丰楼的火，是不是也是这样......？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"麟青砚环顾四周，后厨的厨师们早已乱作一团。而她的目光很快锁定了一个戴着面具的身影。","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"那人似乎对上了她的视线，随即转身消失在人群中。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......！","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"煌，留在这里，保护好莫不服！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"250,0","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哎！你上哪去？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"咳咳......这烟，呛死我了。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#4$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"咳咳咳......那边的立柱上有拉闸......","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BA/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这......这么多......到底该拉哪个......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"charslot","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BA/Avg_bg_58_g15_restaurantlobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"麟青砚身轻如羽，几个起落间，那人已经被逼到角落。","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"只隔着数米的距离，但空气中烟尘弥漫，麟青砚看不清楚那个人的身形。","id":135},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_lightningmagic","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"他正欲再跑时，一道炸雷就落在了他的身旁。","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"站住！","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你再动一下，下一道雷就会落在你头上。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"回答我的问题。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"为什么要在鼎丰楼纵火？你的目标是莫不服，还是其他人？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"之前闹出的几次风波，也是你的手笔吧？","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"还有......卷牍库？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"三番五次地闹出动静，你......还有你的同党，一定意有所指——为什么？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"不肯说？那我就带你回大理寺再慢慢审——","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......麟少卿既然问出了这样的问题，心里难道没有答案？","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"麟少卿到底是看不到真相，还是因为不敢看，才假装看不到？","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#10$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"什——","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"大理寺是个好地方，不过我现在还不想去。","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"另外，你意志不坚的时候，手里的雷霆，没那么可怕。","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴面具的人","text":"......你该清醒一下了。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"等等——","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#10$1","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carwash","volume":"0.6","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，戴面具的人身形已动，麟青砚正要追时，头顶的灭火装置突然开启。","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"冰凉的水倾盆而下，浇得她满头满脸。","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","duration":"0.5","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"惊蛰——","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你没事吧？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......该死。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3F/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的厨师","text":"客人都已经安顿好了，只是有几个人受了惊，好在没人受伤......","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的厨师","text":"我们已经报案了，官府的人应该马上就会到......","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"官府的人，这边不是已经有一位了吗？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的厨师","text":"总厨......您......","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1635_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我没事......多亏了这位姑娘。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"这里也没你们什么事了，都回去吧。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1635_1#1$1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"几名厨师离开后，麟青砚锁上了房间的门。","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"莫先生，可否留您说几句话。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"这位大人，和这位姑娘认识？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"她是我朋友来着。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"莫大厨，她在调查一桩很重要的案子，能不能麻烦您，尽量回答一下她的问题......？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#2$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"哼......我莫某人不喜欢官府的事，但也不喜欢欠人情。今天被你救了一命，这人情是无论如何也还不清了。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"好了。有什么问题，就请问吧。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我想在您的饭店里找一位厨师，他是一桩案子的证人。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"十年前，他应该在刑部死狱大牢里，给那里的死刑犯做“断头饭”。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"专门做断头饭的厨师......也能通过鼎丰楼的考核吗？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"鼎丰楼每年都要在百珍宴上为百官准备菜肴，所以每一位厨师的履历必须清晰明了。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我想，这个厨师应该不难找到。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......大人想叫我怎么回答？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#5$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"先是酒楼无端起火，再是说我们有厨师给人做断头饭。我这鼎丰楼还要不要开下去了？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我体谅先生的难处，所以选在这样私密的场合来向您讨教。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......罢了，都是自己做过的事，没什么不能承认的。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"大人要找的那个厨子，死狱大牢里那个叫莫小六的厨师，就是莫某人。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"啊？！","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"果然......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"做断头饭也不是什么见不得人的活，王侯将相要吃饭，贩夫走卒也要吃饭。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我这手厨艺，就是在死狱大牢里，给天南地北的死刑犯做断头饭练出来的。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我之所以改名隐藏身份，也只是不想给这家饭店带来麻烦罢了。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我开始......有些佩服您了。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我想问您，是否还记得，十年前，有一个被打入大牢，名叫“顾筌”的人？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"如果不记得这个名字的话，您应该还记得，几十年来，唯一一个，被打入死狱，却又被放出去的人。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":254},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"什么？！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等一下！你说我爸？我爸为什么会是死刑犯？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......煌！","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#7$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"你说顾筌？他是你的父亲？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"对......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"您还记得他......","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#3$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"记得......太记得了。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我在大牢里做了那么多年断头饭，见过无数穷凶极恶之徒、奸佞宵小之辈。那些犯人，临行前吃饭的眼神，大抵都是一个样。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"可我从来没有在那座大牢里见过，眼神那样干净的人。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"他和别的犯人不一样，从进入大牢的第一天起，他就从来没有哭天喊地，也没有委屈叫冤过。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"当时连我都很奇怪，像这样的人，怎么会出现在死狱里。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我爸他......怎么会......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"那您是否知道，顾筌当时，是犯了什么罪才被打入死狱？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"当时不知道......","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"当时？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"那是在一年后，我加入了鼎丰楼，开始参与百珍宴，也拿到了几年前百珍宴的菜单——","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"我才知道，当年顾筌在百珍宴上，也向真龙献过一道菜。正巧，就是这位姑娘刚才抽到的，“天下一白”。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"但是，他还在那盘菜旁边放上了一个白面馒头，馒头中间，夹着一块红色的腐乳。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这是......什么意思？为什么献了这样一道菜，就要被打入大牢？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麟青砚，你为什么不说话？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"......你的家人给你讲过太师的事，但没和你讲过她最终的下场？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#13$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"她的......下场？","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#4$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7E/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"四十年前，太师密谋刺杀前任真龙，事败后自尽，其党羽也被彻查，多达数千人......","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"顾筌在百珍宴上献上的那道菜，就是意在给叛臣平反，惹得真龙大怒。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不可能......我爸和我讲过很多次，太师一辈子为国为民，心怀天下，怎么可能是谋逆的叛臣？！","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......史书上的确是这样写的。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"史书上写的就是真的吗？！","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麟青砚，要是史书上全是真的，你又在查什么？！","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"而且......而且我爸后来也没有真的被杀对不对？那不就证明朝堂之上，还是有人相信太师和我爸是清白的吗！","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#13$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这的确是疑点，如果顾筌真的是为太师案入狱，那后来他又为何会被放出来？","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#3$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"这也是让我印象深刻的事......顾筌入狱以后，有两个人见了他，这两个人，我碰巧都认识......","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1619_1#1$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"一个是来给他送饭的人，是当时的大理寺少卿虞澄。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫不服","text":"另一个是带他出去的人......前任礼部尚书，宁述。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_npc_1619_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#10$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"什么......？！","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"快！跟上！立刻包围现场！","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1637_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1637_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":328},{"type":"charslot","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"该死......偏偏这个时候......？！","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1613_1#7$1","duration":"1.5","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"真巧，麟少卿的动作倒是快我一步了。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1613_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......前脚刚到，的确是巧。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_npc_1612_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1613_1#1$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"大理寺调查鼎丰楼失火一案，请所有人配合。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_1613_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谌彻","text":"麟青砚，还有旁边这位姑娘，都和我走一趟吧。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_1613_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":346},{"type":"image","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348}],"characters":["煌","莫不服","麟青砚","戴面具的人","慌张的厨师","门外的声音","谌彻"]}